oducable in: 4.6 and on master when physics engine is set to Jolt Physics\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the provided scene there's a capsule-shaped dynamic body gliding over the boundary between two perfectly  joined height field shapes that are part of the same static body, and ends up with what seems like a ghost collision, despite 'Enhanced Internal Edge Removal' being enabled on both bodies.\n\nThe dynamic body has a friction of zero, and has had all of its angular degrees-of-freedom removed.\n\nHere's what it looks like in the Jolt `Samples` when exporting a snapshot:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa155c7b-09fd-47a2-b090-47ef1229a60c\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the MRP and observe a small jump as the capsule crosses the border between tiles\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[jolt-ghost-collisions.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25458890/jolt-ghost-collisions.zip)\n\nOriginally reported in jrouwe/JoltPhysics#1922","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/rep